    "desc": "Displays suspend errors and their volume, including a Pareto Line to show trends. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over this widget will display the total number of claims per suspend errors.\n•\tPlacing the mouse over the Pareto Line will display the cumulative percentage of claims per suspend errors. \n•\tTo view information for a specific error, select the desired suspend error on the widget. The widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific suspend error only. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tUsing the scroll filter below this widget will filter down claim volumes for specific suspend errors. Using the scroll filter feature will only affect this widget. \n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard.",
